  "text": "Born in Deder, Ethiopia, the author completed his primary and middle school education in his hometown and finished high school in Dire Dawa. He moved to the United States in 2002 through the DV Lottery and has since devoted his life to Christian ministry, teaching, and writing. He earned his Ph.D. in theology through Christ"
